GeneratedPluginRegistrant.java
.cxx/

# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# Except this one, which is deliberately public. It signs the sideloaded TV
# build, and a sideloaded app has no store account behind it and no upload key
# to protect. What it buys is a signature that stays the same between builds,
# so a new APK installs over the old app rather than being refused - which the
# per-machine debug key cannot do. See .github/workflows/tv-keystore.yml.
!nulleig-tv.jks
